the original code in this repository. The upstream terms below are separate
and continue to apply to the ported portions regardless of what you choose.


Derived work notice
===================

The `epoc` library is a port of emokit (https://github.com/openyou/emokit).
The wire-protocol handling, bit masks and lookup tables are derived from
emokit's `src/emokit.c` and `include/emokit/emokit.h`.

Note that emokit is dual-described upstream: its per-file headers carry an
ISC-style permission notice, while its LICENSE file dedicates the work to the
public domain with a 3-clause-BSD fallback. Both are reproduced below, since
the ported files carry the former and the project as a whole carries the
latter.


